            <div xml:id="m-a5f33c74-0eb2-45d1-9ba7-4a09eb8dfee5">
              <lg xml:id="m-a5c4b662-394f-44cf-8f55-4313b085b298">
                <l xml:id="m-8bca407f-ad44-4e0d-b601-9e9038b40e77" facs="#m-5183e277-b88d-425f-b3f0-482fefa45d06" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-f2005558-4455-4c76-8285-24910bcd9fd0" facs="#m-9c3c439b-1961-4675-a11d-721d532e82c7" label="ambiguous">387</l><l xml:id="m-6d0ee04f-da76-4279-b921-6cefeded8cb9" facs="#m-39d819d1-5b53-477d-8383-4fca528a80c6" label="lyrics-like">47. Quis est hómo, qui vivet, et non vidébit mórtem :“éruet ánimam</l><l xml:id="m-09800f4d-e99a-487d-8056-3cdadf8af4b4" facs="#m-e02f9772-07c2-4e72-9c7d-746cf337662c" label="lyrics-like">súam de mánu inferi?</l><l xml:id="m-dc6d5611-e8fe-4522-801a-eb3f274c210b" facs="#m-6124807a-47e5-4fdd-a029-ee67723c7da1" label="lyrics-like">48. Ubi sunt misericórdiae túae antíquae, Dómine,“ sicut jurásti</l><l xml:id="m-0ca6c6c8-f82e-481c-8ff6-2ccd19553c22" facs="#m-8a250dc5-11cf-46a5-aba3-0e4e86925d3c" label="lyrics-like">Dávid in veritáte túa ?</l><l xml:id="m-5fed3dda-a029-4d47-b13f-1cc409f509f6" facs="#m-46c82ac7-f87d-4eae-bbef-044a2a36693c" label="lyrics-like">49. Mémor ésto, Dómine, oppróbrii servórum tuórum* (quod continui</l><l xml:id="m-f598f190-aaf1-47c3-afd8-0e434a905cf9" facs="#m-6f615e68-fb9a-4a7d-90d9-90f4df673266" label="lyrics-like">in sínu méo) multárum Géntium:</l><l xml:id="m-fc966edf-93f7-4d0d-b83f-7ec67f7f7fa0" facs="#m-08492c8b-9d21-46f7-a821-739147a48622" label="lyrics-like">50. Quod exprobravérunt inimíci tút, Dómine, * quod exprobravérunt</l><l xml:id="m-083e685c-ab38-4735-8ae1-f869a82fd3b4" facs="#m-ad61c953-c783-49cd-a41a-2c1809c680cf" label="lyrics-like">commutatiónem Christi tui.</l><l xml:id="m-2d8ddaa7-08f9-4371-b8b9-dc182f8f6363" facs="#m-78946a0e-bb58-4af1-9a0b-e637c00cd113" label="lyrics-like">51. Benedictus Dóminus in aetérnum:" fiat.</l><l xml:id="m-96c5d138-c630-4b99-a202-14d7e3928238" facs="#m-a5a118ce-2fb7-4a31-aa07-ab645d6ec184" label="lyrics-like">52. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritai Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-d54bd9e6-dd4b-4439-8c67-eb2b92043536" facs="#m-ecfd7ef3-4474-4cc0-98bf-5bd4ecf54813" label="lyrics-like">53. sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, *et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ba32294-b453-47c1-a95e-38d547e16876" facs="#m-2c2b8cb3-30ff-4008-8299-f6bb3e85d66f" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-4f469730-ef2c-46d1-921b-7f2ca75e1597" facs="#m-2e914296-88d6-43c9-8f7c-425cffc5ef0c" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-f2677132-b462-4714-a40c-3049966568b7" facs="#m-43f45fb3-a05c-4b7e-83ea-8d6407c5270c" label="ambiguous">4.A</l><l xml:id="m-b022f06c-d700-4e85-b63c-2ebe17c854e9" facs="#m-26f99763-d270-4cb3-9256-ea9e3ed82dd2" label="lyrics-like">Aeténtur caéli, et exsúltet térra</l><l xml:id="m-411c3ed7-31dd-4f82-8189-078996779ab8" facs="#m-025d74c2-6706-42ef-9bf0-4bb47f7c5817" label="lyrics-like">ante fá-ci-em</l><l xml:id="m-a3debb9a-5304-403e-aa00-7350f370b9fc" facs="#m-0f132c7f-4853-46da-bd52-cf0b5dc7df24" label="lyrics-like">Dómimi, quó-ni-am vé-nit.</l><l xml:id="m-4c4c4d11-e2f0-4a68-8593-b13adf982030" facs="#m-17fd8806-de86-44f0-8cd2-f186fa30a366" label="ambiguous">Psalm 95.</l><l xml:id="m-62ffc7bd-2e97-45b5-84fc-72c08f0922e8" facs="#m-7288845c-855d-4359-9359-e1831e073d75" label="lyrics-like">1. Cantá-te Dómino cánti-cum nó-vum: *cantáte Dómino,</l><l xml:id="m-319d4c93-deaa-4074-8c05-17ca63867f1c" facs="#m-f3282172-d3ea-496d-bb9f-fb680422c192" label="lyrics-like">ómnis tér-ra. Flex: pátri-ae génti-um,</l><l xml:id="m-9f4ac133-10d3-469c-804d-adf7496e8fb2" facs="#m-7f257d28-7bf0-414d-a672-7d1e87754689" label="lyrics-like">2. Cantáte Dómino, et benedicite nómini éjus:“annuntiáte de die</l><l xml:id="m-6cecf958-3355-4eef-b5ad-cdc27de3e395" facs="#m-0bc33d6d-043d-472a-88a0-9a6aa5fa63c2" label="lyrics-like">in díem salutáre ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-4884328c-e151-4f0e-bae5-388f8c180aba" facs="#m-598cb45b-7ee2-422b-b806-383be0a28e8e" label="lyrics-like">3. Annuntiáte inter Géntes glóriam éjus, * in ómnibus pópulis mira¬</l><l xml:id="m-e8b91832-18a5-4e40-b99b-a75c2d5c9e7b" facs="#m-b6fe3883-1ec4-49de-8d6d-9d9230bf0157" label="lyrics-like">oitia éjus</l><l xml:id="m-bd2b865a-a259-4e60-9d03-530022de0af6" facs="#m-22068a14-1d5a-4700-96a4-9132eb495452" label="lyrics-like">4. Quóniam mágnus Dóminus, et laudábilis nimis: “terribilis est</l><l xml:id="m-fad4cef4-5a4c-4c4c-b52f-bd2b956bf5e9" facs="#m-bd4a1638-f92c-4e67-93dc-c4a40dd861c5" label="lyrics-like">super ômnes déos.</l><l xml:id="m-20215d1c-cdb8-449e-a0d8-388829fe8088" facs="#m-465e3c31-8b09-429f-b227-056382616643" label="lyrics-like">5. Quóniam ómnes dii Géntium daemónia:“Dóminus autem caélos</l><l xml:id="m-22d16710-bbaa-40c0-ab12-73dba941ee3c" facs="#m-93742c15-5864-40e0-85e3-fa35c0a786fd" label="lyrics-like">fécit.</l><l xml:id="m-d2aa0b90-a198-4c34-bb94-f981b0ea4dfc" facs="#m-d8036356-c9cb-42fc-86c6-3aee9659933a" label="lyrics-like">6. Conféssio, et pulchritúdo in conspéctu éjus:“sanctimónia et</l><l xml:id="m-b9ddb2d1-f325-4db8-b4c3-724417d66169" facs="#m-13be46ff-fff2-4c56-8ca2-7508c9f3177f" label="lyrics-like">magnificéntia in sanctificatióne éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-fe8b6a38-2467-46cf-b63b-2ff8ba9ab226" facs="#m-8a0f7443-5606-4443-809f-914aca08a6f0" label="lyrics-like">7. Afférte Dómino, pátriae Géntium, t afférte Dómino glóriam et</l><l xml:id="m-0b447731-5db7-44e5-bb83-4803f49d25d9" facs="#m-9db11461-9010-478c-bc8c-6a0c46267a10" label="lyrics-like">honórem:“afférte Dómino glóriam nómint éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-f2d1b3eb-e0f2-496c-8c46-332c0f33787e" facs="#m-f055ed87-b568-4be7-9795-20bd9173fb44" label="lyrics-like">8. Tóllite hóstias, et introite in átria éjus:“adorâte Dóminum in</l><l xml:id="m-eb13260e-471e-4362-b497-aa76837f0e98" facs="#m-b7611efd-eb29-444f-a9ce-14a723707781" label="lyrics-like">átrio sáncto éjus.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>